{"seq":1,"slug":"annotation-scheme-label-design","title":"标注体系与标签集设计建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/annotation-schema-agreement/annotation-scheme-label-design","wordCount":2757,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"标注体系与标签集设计建模\">标注体系与标签集设计建模</h1><p>一个标注项目失败通常不是标注者不努力，而是标签集本身没设计好：两个标签在真实语料上无法区分，或者一条规范的边界在手册里从未被写下来。Universal Dependencies 从 2016 年 v2 规范到 2026 年 5 月 Release 2.18，已覆盖 200 多个 treebank、150 多种语言（<a href=\"https://universaldependencies.org/\">universaldependencies.org</a>），它能在如此规模上保持机器可校验的一致，靠的是把「标注体系」当成一层可执行的数据模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>标注体系（annotation scheme）是三层绑在一起的产物：<strong>标签集</strong>定义「有哪些类」，<strong>结构约定</strong>定义「标注挂在哪里、彼此怎么连」，<strong>数据格式</strong>定义「写出来是什么字节」。三者缺一，标签集就只是术语表，无法被工具校验，也无法被下游消费。结构约定决定表达力上限，选择取决于要回答的语言学问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构族</th>\n<th>标注单元</th>\n<th>典型产物</th>\n<th>适用问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>序列标注</td>\n<td>每 token 一个标签</td>\n<td>BIO / IOB2 列</td>\n<td>词性、NER、分块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>片段 + 关系</td>\n<td>字符偏移片段 + 二元关系</td>\n<td>brat <code>.ann</code>、UIMA CAS</td>\n<td>实体关系抽取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依存图</td>\n<td>token 之间的有向弧</td>\n<td>CoNLL-U 的 <code>HEAD</code>/<code>DEPREL</code></td>\n<td>句法结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架语义</td>\n<td>触发词 + 角色槽</td>\n<td>FrameNet 式、PropBank</td>\n<td>事件语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多维评分</td>\n<td>错误片段 + 维度 + 严重度</td>\n<td>MQM 标注</td>\n<td>翻译/生成质量评价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常见错误是把「标签集设计」和「数据格式设计」分开做——先定标签，再决定用什么格式写。正确顺序相反：格式约束会反过来限制标签集能表达什么。CoNLL-U 规定句法依存「必须严格是一棵树」（<em>must be strictly a tree</em>）、<code>DEPREL</code> 必须匹配 <code>[a-z]+(:[a-z]+)?</code>（<a href=\"https://universaldependencies.org/format.html\">format.html</a>），这两条就直接否决了「一个 token 有多个句法头」的标签设计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[明确要回答的语言学问题] --&gt; B[定义标签集: 类别/粒度/闭合性]&#10;    B --&gt; C[定义结构约定: 片段/关系/图]&#10;    C --&gt; D[选定可校验的数据格式]&#10;    D --&gt; E[写标注手册: 每类的边界与反例]&#10;    E --&gt; F[小规模试点标注]&#10;    F --&gt; G{一致性是否达标}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| H[回到 B: 合并或拆分标签]&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I[冻结 schema 并规模化]&#10;    I --&gt; J[收集边界案例 触发下一版]\">flowchart TD\n    A[明确要回答的语言学问题] --&gt; B[定义标签集: 类别/粒度/闭合性]\n    B --&gt; C[定义结构约定: 片段/关系/图]\n    C --&gt; D[选定可校验的数据格式]\n    D --&gt; E[写标注手册: 每类的边界与反例]\n    E --&gt; F[小规模试点标注]\n    F --&gt; G{一致性是否达标}\n    G --&gt;|否| H[回到 B: 合并或拆分标签]\n    G --&gt;|是| I[冻结 schema 并规模化]\n    I --&gt; J[收集边界案例 触发下一版]</pre><h2 id=\"标签集的粒度-闭合性与正交性\">标签集的粒度、闭合性与正交性</h2><p>标签集设计的三个维度是<strong>粒度</strong>（多细）、<strong>闭合性</strong>（类别表是否固定）与<strong>正交性</strong>（维度之间是否独立）。每动一个，都会改变标注者需要的推理量与可达到的一致性上限。</p>\n<p><strong>粒度</strong>错误是最高频的失败模式。标签太粗，标注者会把语义不同的东西塞进同一类（把「机构」和「组织」合并），下游无法区分；太细则产生大量零频类别，标注者面对稀疏边界只能凭猜。经验判据：每个标签在试点语料里至少有几十次出现。</p>\n<p><strong>闭合性</strong>是词表型与句法型任务的分水岭。UD 的 UPOS 词性是<strong>闭合集</strong>，恰好 17 个（6 开放类 + 8 封闭类 + 3 其他类 <code>PUNCT</code>/<code>SYM</code>/<code>X</code>），句法关系是 37 个 universal relation（<a href=\"https://universaldependencies.org/u/pos/index.html\">u/pos</a>、<a href=\"https://universaldependencies.org/u/dep/index.html\">u/dep</a>）。好处是任何标注都能被完整校验；代价是遇到规范未覆盖的现象时，标注者只能勉强归入最近的类，制造系统性偏差。UD 的解法是允许 <code>base_type:subtype</code> 形式的语言特有子类型，并指定 11 个为半强制。</p>\n<p><strong>正交性</strong>处理维度之间的乘法爆炸。UD v2 用 feature 维度描述形态，共 27 个 universal feature，粗分为 4 词汇、18 屈折、5 其他（<code>Abbr</code>/<code>Typo</code>/<code>Foreign</code>/<code>ExtPos</code>/<code>Clusivity</code>）（<a href=\"https://universaldependencies.org/u/feat/index.html\">u/feat</a>）。若摊平成单一标签集，标签数会组合式增长：设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个正交特征各取值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，理论上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>comb</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{comb}} = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">comb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远超真实语料所能区分的数量。正确落地方式是<strong>保持维度分离</strong>：让 <code>Number</code> 和 <code>Case</code> 作为独立槽位，而不是造 <code>NOUN_SG_DAT</code> 这样的复合标签——复合标签让稀疏性弥散，一致性统计随之失真。另一个反模式是<strong>万能「其他」类</strong>：为「覆盖所有情况」加入的 <code>OTHER</code> 会吸收边界争议，使该类内部极不一致；更稳的做法是拆成可判定的兜底类，并在手册里写明触发条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从标注手册到可执行-schema\">从标注手册到可执行 schema</h2><p>手册是给人读的，schema 是给机器校验的。二者只靠文字描述对应，规范就一定会漂移；成熟项目的做法是让<strong>格式本身成为规范的一部分</strong>。</p>\n<p>brat 的 standoff 格式是一个被广泛复用的最小 schema：<code>&lt;doc&gt;.txt</code> 保持原样不被修改，字符偏移零基、含起始不含结束；<code>&lt;doc&gt;.ann</code> 每行以 <code>ID[TAB]字段</code> 构成，用行首字母区分五种结构（<a href=\"https://brat.nlplab.org/standoff.html\">brat.nlplab.org/standoff.html</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"T1\tOrganization 0 4\tSony&#10;R1\tOrigin Arg1:T3 Arg2:T4&#10;E1\tMERGE-ORG:T2 Org1:T1 Org2:T3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>T1\tOrganization 0 4\tSony</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>R1\tOrigin Arg1:T3 Arg2:T4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>E1\tMERGE-ORG:T2 Org1:T1 Org2:T3</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>T</code> 是文本片段，<code>R</code> 是二元关系，<code>E</code> 是事件（触发词本身是一个 <code>T</code>）；属性（<code>A</code>）与注释（<code>#</code>）各有固定行格式，不连续片段用分号分隔的多段偏移表示。价值在于<strong>每种结构都有唯一的行级文法</strong>，写正则即可校验。选择标注平台时，schema 的可迁移性比界面更重要。INCEpTION 支持在浏览器自定义标注体系，可叠加实体、关系、共指链、句法、框架等层，导出为 UIMA CAS XMI/JSON（保留自定义层）或 CoNLL-U（标准层）（<a href=\"https://inception-project.github.io/\">inception-project.github.io</a>）。<strong>自定义 schema 需要自带序列化契约</strong>，否则只会锁死在某个工具里。</p>\n<p>schema 落地后必须配<strong>自动校验</strong>。UD 工具链是范例：<code>validate.py</code> 检查单个 CoNLL-U 文件内容、<code>check_files.pl</code> 检查仓库级结构、<code>check_sentence_ids.pl</code> 保证 <code>sent_id</code> 唯一、<code>overlap.py</code> 检出跨文件重复 token 序列（防训练/测试泄漏）（<a href=\"https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/tools\">UD tools</a>）。做成 CI 门，一致性就从纪律问题转成了工程问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性度量-alpha-kappa-与它们的适用边界\">一致性度量：alpha、kappa 与它们的适用边界</h2><p>度量方式要跟 schema 的形态匹配，否则数字会误导决策。<strong>Cohen&#39;s kappa</strong> 只适用于两个标注者、名义类别：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa = \\frac{p_o - p_e}{1 - p_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是观测一致率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是把各标注者的边际类别频率相乘求和得到的机会一致率。致命弱点是 <strong>kappa 悖论</strong>：两个标注者的边际分布差异大时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被抬高，kappa 随之骤降，即便原始一致率相同——维基百科的例子中两对标注者原始一致率都是 60%，kappa 却分别约 0.13 与 0.26（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cohen%27s_kappa\">Cohen&#39;s kappa</a>）。因此「kappa ≥ 0.8 才算合格」不能跨数据集硬套；Landis &amp; Koch 分档也被指出更多是个人意见。</p>\n<p><strong>Krippendorff&#39;s alpha</strong> 支持任意数量标注者、任意类别数、多种度量层级（名义/序数/区间/比率），并能处理缺失值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 1 - \\frac{D_o}{D_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单元内观测到的分歧，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是全部可配对值的期望分歧。对名义数据，差异函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta(v,v&#x27;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在取值相等时为 0、不等时为 1；对区间数据为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(v-v&#x27;)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。计算时先排出「单元 × 标注者」表，剔除无法配对的判定（单元至少要有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_j \\ge 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个判定），构造对称巧合矩阵后代入差异函数。阈值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.800</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\ge 0.800</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.800</span></span></span></span></span> 可依赖，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.667</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.800</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.667 \\le \\alpha &lt; 0.800</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.667</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.800</span></span></span></span></span> 只能作试探结论，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.667</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 0.667</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.667</span></span></span></span></span> 应弃用（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Krippendorff%27s_alpha\">Krippendorff&#39;s alpha</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>标注者数</th>\n<th>数据层级</th>\n<th>缺失值</th>\n<th>主要陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cohen&#39;s kappa</td>\n<td>恰好 2</td>\n<td>名义</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>边际分布不平衡压低数值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权 kappa</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>序数/区间</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>权重选择改变结论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fleiss&#39; kappa</td>\n<td>≥2</td>\n<td>名义</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>各单元标注者数须相等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Krippendorff&#39;s alpha</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>全部层级</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>差异函数须匹配层级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型规则：<strong>两人名义</strong>用 kappa；<strong>多人/序数/有缺失</strong>用 alpha；<strong>序数但固定两人</strong>用加权 kappa。把序数当名义算，会把「差一级」和「差三级」视为同等错误，低估一致性。</p>\n<p>更根本的判据是：<strong>一致性低时先怀疑 schema，而不是先怀疑标注者</strong>。低 alpha 有三种成因——标签边界不清（手册缺陷）、标注者训练不足（流程缺陷）、任务本身存在真实主观变异（数据属性）。第三类要区别对待：Plank 在 2022 年 EMNLP 的立场论文中指出，标注分歧常常反映<strong>真实的人类变异、主观性或多个合理答案</strong>，把所有变异当噪声剔除会扭曲数据质量与模型评估；她建议<strong>保留未聚合的原始标签</strong>并把变异纳入评估（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.02570\">arXiv:2211.02570</a>）。MQM 正是这类 schema：它分 Accuracy、Fluency、Terminology、Style 等维度并附严重度，评价者对严重度的判定天然分歧（<a href=\"https://themqm.org/\">themqm.org</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标签集版本化与标签漂移治理\">标签集版本化与标签漂移治理</h2><p>schema 冻结并投入规模化标注后，最大的持续风险是<strong>标签漂移</strong>：标注者对同一个标签的理解随长期工作缓慢偏移，前后标注不可比，而格式校验看不出这一点。</p>\n<p>第一道防线是<strong>把手册纳入版本控制</strong>。UD 专门维护「Guidelines change history」记录规范变更，正因 guideline 的每次修改都会改变旧数据的可比性。判据是：<strong>凡改变已有标注判定结果的修改都是破坏性变更</strong>，必须 bump 主版本，并决定旧数据重标还是标注版本号后共存。</p>\n<p>第二道防线是<strong>在数据里显式记录版本</strong>：文档级元数据写 <code>scheme_version</code>；或像 UD 那样，让数据 survey 列出 treebank 中实际使用的 feature 与值（<a href=\"https://universaldependencies.org/guidelines.html\">UD guidelines</a>）。若某语言特有子类型在几轮标注后使用频率翻倍，说明标注者正在用它表达手册未覆盖的现象，正是下一版该补的缺口。</p>\n<p>第三道防线是<strong>仲裁与金标准维护</strong>。同一段文本被多人标注需要裁决时，要把分歧转成决定：多数投票、专家仲裁，还是保留全部标注。事实性强的句法标注收敛到单一金标准合理；主观性强的质量评价，保留多标注与分布更有信息量。<strong>分歧本身要作为数据保存</strong>——它是发现边界缺陷的最快来源；还应监控每个标签的推翻率与跨批次频次，突变即边界出了问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>标注体系 = 标签集 + 结构约定 + 数据格式，三层一起设计；格式约束会反过来否决某些标签设计（如 CoNLL-U 的「严格树」要求）。</li>\n<li>标签集的三个维度是粒度、闭合性、正交性；正交特征应保持维度分离，避免复合标签造成的稀疏与一致性失真；「其他」类应拆成可判定的兜底类。</li>\n<li>schema 要让格式成为规范的一部分，并配自动校验把一致性从纪律问题转成工程问题（brat 行级文法、CoNLL-U 10 字段、INCEpTION 导出契约）。</li>\n<li>一致性度量要与 schema 匹配：两人名义用 kappa，多人/序数/缺失用 alpha；kappa 悖论说明阈值不能跨数据集硬套。</li>\n<li>低一致性先怀疑 schema 而非标注者；真实主观变异应保留为多标签分布而非当作噪声剔除。</li>\n<li>漂移治理靠手册版本控制、数据内记录 <code>scheme_version</code>，以及标签推翻率监控。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同 hub 的 <a href=\"../corpus-format-query-index/\">语料格式、查询与索引</a> 章节展开 CoNLL-U 等格式的查询与索引——标签集定下的结构约定，要在那一层落成可查询的数据。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"标注体系与标签集设计建模","id":"标注体系与标签集设计建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"标签集的粒度、闭合性与正交性","id":"标签集的粒度-闭合性与正交性"},{"level":2,"text":"从标注手册到可执行 schema","id":"从标注手册到可执行-schema"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性度量：alpha、kappa 与它们的适用边界","id":"一致性度量-alpha-kappa-与它们的适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"标签集版本化与标签漂移治理","id":"标签集版本化与标签漂移治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代表性度量与语料偏置审计实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/corpus-design-representativeness-model/representativeness-bias-audit"},"next":{"title":"标注规范迭代、培训与仲裁流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/annotation-schema-agreement/guideline-iteration-adjudication"}}